 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 504764,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You are designing a brick patio made of square bricks 5 cm thick, but you need to determine the width and length of those bricks. The patio will be 400 cm by 540 cm. What are the largest size square bricks that can be used so that you do not need to cut any bricks?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You need the GCD of the width and length: 400 cm by 540 cm</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Number</td>\n<td colspan=\"9\">Factors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>540</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Common</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Greatest common divisor = <span data-math=\"2 \\times 2 \\times 5 = 20\\ {\\rm cm}\"></span></p>\n<p>The largest square bricks that can be used are 20 cm by 20 cm.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The largest square bricks that can be used are 20 cm by 20 cm."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
